== {{dlc|nar}} Tips ==
Finding '''Steven''' for the [[collection page]] can be difficult, as the boss {{E|Steven}} rarely appears and has a high chance to drop {{i|Little Steven}} instead of '''Steven'''. The following method can be used to obtain '''Steven'''.

* Make sure {{E|Steven}} is unlocked.
* Play as {{C|Azazel}}.
** His [[flight|fly ability]] and his version of {{i|Brimstone}} grants fast progress.
* Restart until {{s|Basement}} appears.
* Rush to the {{R|Boss Room}}.
** The given {{p|0 - The Fool}} can return Azazel instantly to the start if he went a wrong way.
** By using {{E|Black Heart}}s, slow rooms can be cleared quickly.
** Skipping any special rooms (such as {{R|Treasure Room}}s or {{R|Curse Room}}s) and leaving any [[pickup]]s behind allow faster rushing.
* The process is repeated until {{E|Steven}} is found as the first boss and until he drops ''Steven''
* Alternatively, Steven is guaranteed to appear if {{i|Spindown Dice}} is used on {{i|Pentagram}}.

== Notes ==
* This item is more likely to be dropped by {{E|Steven}} if {{i|Little Steven}} has already been picked up.

